  "narrative": "No assessments are due, so the accepted supplied-dataset map remains: feature_037=1 lowers outcome_001; feature_002=1 and feature_010=1 raise outcome_001; feature_063=1 lowers outcome_001 chiefly in contexts where feature_037 and feature_010 are absent, with a strong and now independently validated feature_038 high-context modification within the feature_037=0/feature_010=0 stratum. The key unresolved scientific question is how far this feature_038 context extends and whether dominant markers attenuate it outside the accepted double-negative stratum. I registered six new feature_063/feature_038 comparisons. First, direct overall high-feature_038 and low-feature_038 mean contrasts test whether a meaningful negative feature_063 association is visible simply by assay context, not only by the double-negative context; I expect high-feature_038 to be negative and low-feature_038 to be null or weak, because low-feature_038 complements were near null. Second, an overall feature_063-by-feature_038 interaction tests whether the high-minus-low context difference survives when all dominant-marker contexts are pooled. Third, I registered feature_063-by-feature_037 and feature_063-by-feature_010 attenuation interactions restricted to high feature_038. The expected direction is positive for these attenuation claims because the accepted strong negative feature_063 contrast is much weaker when the other dominant marker is present. Fourth, I registered a feature_063-by-feature_038 interaction restricted to feature_037=1; if the feature_038 context persists despite feature_037, the high-feature_038 contrast should be more negative than the low-feature_038 complement, giving direction -1. These proposals are deliberately focused rather than broad: they refine the strongest current signal and test plausible alternatives including attenuation, dilution, and null context. All remain descriptive associations in this supplied dataset only, not causal, biological, mechanistic, or generalizable claims.",
  "research_notes": "Current accepted descriptive supplied-dataset claims: feature_037=1 lowers outcome_001 (H6 and many strata); feature_002=1 and feature_010=1 raise outcome_001 (H35/H36-H39/H42/H46-H50/H52/H54-H55/H48/H43-H53/H53-H55 as accepted); feature_063=1 lowers outcome_001 in feature_010=0 and especially feature_037=0/feature_010=0 contexts (H87/H90/H61/H67/H68/H95/H96), with strong feature_038 high-context association in the H87 stratum (H105, accepted/closed; H93 residual accepted). H103 feature_063-by-feature_038 interaction in the feature_037=0/feature_010=0 stratum is accepted and validated (discovery +0.520 [0.357,0.683]; independent +0.492 [0.257,0.728]). H94 low-feature_038 residual complement is null. Negative/rejected: no meaningful broad main effects for feature_007/058/015/041; H69/H70 no meaningful feature_063 effect in feature_037=1 or feature_010=1 broad; H104 no broad long-logPFS feature_063 interaction; H107 feature_036 no context modification; H106 as hypothesized feature_018 high context is rejected; H40/H44/H45 mostly support additivity of dominant markers. Unresolved active/deferred: H110 reversed feature_018 interaction signed +0.272 [0.099,0.445], indicating low feature_018 may have a stronger negative feature_063 contrast; H111/H112 direct feature_018 high/low contrasts registered/active but no evidence; H108/H109 broad attenuation interactions are suggestive but underpowered/wide; H41 possible feature_002-by-feature_010 interaction; H66 overall marginal feature_063 diluted by contexts with null association; H88/H89 broader mixed feature_063 contexts unresolved; logPFS robustness claims H97-H102 active but no evidence; low-priority residual flag screens H80/H81/H83-H86 are not useful now and should not be analyzed unless capacity remains. Newly registered feature_038-context claims (expected H113-H118): (1) direct overall high-feature_038 feature_063 effect, expecting negative; (2) direct overall low-feature_038 feature_063 effect, expecting null; (3) overall feature_063-by-feature_038 interaction, expecting stronger high feature_038; (4) feature_063-by-feature_037 attenuation within high feature_038, direction +1 if feature_037 present weakens the negative feature_063 contrast; (5) feature_063-by-feature_010 attenuation within high feature_038, same logic; (6) feature_063-by-feature_038 interaction within feature_037=1, direction -1 if feature_038 high context persists despite feature_037. Analyze priority: H111/H112 plus these six new feature_038-context claims, then H97-H100 or H101/H102 logPFS robustness for central markers if capacity remains. Do not request broad validation for feature_063 main effect unless the overall feature_038-context claims are accepted or a dominant-context interaction is robustly accepted; independent validation budget remains limited."
